    "overview": "The portfolio behaves like a carefully edited record of practice: restrained shared chrome frames dense, authored project evidence. The home establishes one near-black editorial world, while each case study is allowed to keep the palette, imagery, and material character inherited from its Figma source. Hierarchy comes from scale, spacing, hairline rules, and the work itself. Motion is limited to navigation state, focus, image reveal, and modest hover enlargement so it never competes with long-form reading.",
